patch=1,EE,20145D2C,extended,13E00006

[Automatic Blue Earth if available]
description=Activate Dual the Sun with Mao in the party. Only works on New Game+. Also extends enemy Hi-Ougi if Eugene Mao and Hilda are in the party, which may make the party transparent.
author=Sora3100
patch=1,EE,20145D10,extended,1000000A

// Original cheats

[Double arte slots]
description=L3 in the arte menu swaps to a second page of arte slots. Hold the button left unbound in the battle key settings (L2 by default) in battle to use it: that button + direction uses that arte, + × a random one.
